{"ticker":"JUBLFOOD","symbol":"JUBLFOOD","instrumentId":3110600,"name":"Jubilant Foodworks","industry":"NSE-Retail-Restaurants","about":"Jubilant FoodWorks Ltd., part of the Jubilant Bhartia Group, is India’s largest foodservice company, holding exclusive master franchise rights for Domino’s Pizza, Popeyes, and Dunkin’ in India and neighboring countries. The company operates 1,995 Domino’s stores across 421 cities in India, as well as 42 Popeyes and 31 Dunkin’ outlets. It has also introduced its own Chinese cuisine brand, Hong’s Kitchen, with 28 restaurants. Internationally, its subsidiary DP Eurasia N.V. manages 720 Domino’s stores in Turkey, Azerbaijan, and Georgia. With a strong presence across multiple countries, Jubilant FoodWorks continues to expand and innovate in the quick-service restaurant industry.","website":"www.jubilantfoodworks.com","location":"INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:33:35.673Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":421.3,"changePct":0.08314526665875348,"week52High":609.35,"week52Low":404},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹27,799 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹10,114 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"395,907,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"311"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"356,865,330"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.28%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"12.13"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"15.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.12"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.19"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-3%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"75.77"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"84–245"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"18.7%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"28.7"},{"label":"Volume","value":"921,514"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,700,996"},{"label":"Master score","value":"36"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"27"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"27"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"62"},{"label":"Acc/Dis ratin